    FIELD --> RESULTS["Raw results, primary pair<br/>SPARC coverage 89.41, Winkler 20.25, AQL 1.254, AQCR 0.11<br/>LQR 73.13, 24.43, 1.171, 31.99<br/>MLP 87.37, 23.34, 1.404<br/>LSTM 74.20, Transformer 76.67, XGB 79.34, RF 32.19"]
