    RESULTS --> CAL["Calibrated (flat split-conformal)<br/>SPARC cov 91.90, width 13.90, Winkler 18.20 (soft; hard 18.00)<br/>LQR cov 91.82, width 12.71, Winkler 20.03<br/>MLP cov 94.27, width 17.78, Winkler 20.61<br/>= coverage equalized; SPARC wins width-efficiency"]
    RESULTS --> HONEST["Honest negatives<br/>LQR wins raw AQL (1.171 vs 1.254, p=0.015)<br/>CRPS parity (1.910 vs 2.074)<br/>one ablation (no path embed, AQL 1.191) edges us<br/>scope: central 90% band, extreme events out of scope"]
    ABLWHAT --> ABLTAB["Ablations (raw coverage; calibrated Winkler)<br/>No attention: 89.41 → 77.48 (-11.93pp), AQL 1.254 → 1.225<br/>= attention is the load-bearing calibration mechanism<br/>No identity -4.71pp vs no-μ -1.09pp = WHICH binds beats HOW large<br/>No temporal: AQL 1.682 = temporal drives point error<br/>No lags ≈ full (88.64) = lagged history redundant"]
    ABLTAB --> ATTN_D5["Mechanism evidence<br/>attention 0.23-0.26 (mean 0.25) on top-3 μ slots<br/>about 12x the uniform 0.020<br/>peaks 0.260 at the highest-μ bin (max μ 84.8)"]
  end

