    DEC --> LIM["Honest limitations<br/>no method is PIT-uniform<br/>AQL and CRPS are parity, not superiority<br/>cross-year error edge does not hold<br/>seasonal 3-window claim not in the canonical build<br/>one market, one year, one headline pair<br/>scope: central 90% band; extreme tail events out of scope"]
